      "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Backed by <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">over 45 years</span> of clinical history.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Novae Dual Mobility cups demonstrated excellent survivorship at 10-year follow-up.<sup>4​</sup></span></p>\n",
